{"seq":2,"slug":"rl-grasping","title":"强化学习抓取策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/rl-grasping","wordCount":1504,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"强化学习抓取策略\">强化学习抓取策略</h1><p><a href=\"imitation-learning\">模仿学习与示教</a>能教机器人复现人类示范，但学不到示范里没有的东西——它的天花板就是示范本身。强化学习换了个问法：不给标准答案，只给一个&quot;抓成功了加分、失败了不加&quot;的奖励信号，让机器人在试错中自己摸索出策略，甚至发现人类想不到的抓法。它能突破示范上限，但代价是样本效率低、奖励难设计、真机试错危险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>强化学习把抓取建模为马尔可夫决策过程（MDP）：状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如点云、图像、关节角）、动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（夹爪位姿增量或目标）、奖励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（抓取成功与否），目标是学一个策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 最大化累积奖励。抓取场景的三大难题——稀疏奖励、样本效率、仿真到真机的鸿沟（sim-to-real）——决定了主流技术选型：仿真大规模训练 + 域随机化 + 高效算法（PPO、SAC、Qт-Opt）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[抓取作为 MDP] --&gt; B[状态: 点云/图像/关节]&#10;    A --&gt; C[动作: 夹爪位姿/增量]&#10;    A --&gt; D[奖励: 抓取成功+1]&#10;    D --&gt; E[稀疏奖励难题]&#10;    E --&gt; F[奖励塑形/HER/课程学习]&#10;    B --&gt; G[仿真大规模训练]&#10;    G --&gt; H[域随机化 抗 sim-to-real]&#10;    H --&gt; I[迁移到真机]&#10;    F --&gt; J[算法: PPO/SAC/QT-Opt]\">flowchart TD\n    A[抓取作为 MDP] --&gt; B[状态: 点云/图像/关节]\n    A --&gt; C[动作: 夹爪位姿/增量]\n    A --&gt; D[奖励: 抓取成功+1]\n    D --&gt; E[稀疏奖励难题]\n    E --&gt; F[奖励塑形/HER/课程学习]\n    B --&gt; G[仿真大规模训练]\n    G --&gt; H[域随机化 抗 sim-to-real]\n    H --&gt; I[迁移到真机]\n    F --&gt; J[算法: PPO/SAC/QT-Opt]</pre><p>下表对比抓取常用 RL 范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在线策略</td>\n<td>PPO、TRPO</td>\n<td>实时交互</td>\n<td>稳定、样本效率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线策略</td>\n<td>SAC、QT-Opt</td>\n<td>经验回放</td>\n<td>样本效率高、可用历史数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模真机</td>\n<td>QT-Opt、MT-Opt</td>\n<td>多机器人采集</td>\n<td>真实但成本极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仿真+迁移</td>\n<td>PPO + 域随机化</td>\n<td>仿真器并行</td>\n<td>廉价、需跨域 gap</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"抓取作为强化学习问题\">抓取作为强化学习问题</h2><p>把抓取写成 MDP 后，目标是最大化期望折扣回报：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>π</mi></munder><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^* = \\arg\\max_\\pi\\ \\mathbb{E}_{\\tau \\sim \\pi}\\left[\\sum_{t=0}^{T} \\gamma^t r_t\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是折扣因子。最自然的奖励是稀疏的——抓起来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。但稀疏奖励让探索极难：随机动作几乎永远抓不到，没有梯度信号引导学习。这是抓取 RL 的头号障碍。</p>\n<p>破解稀疏奖励有几条路。**奖励塑形（reward shaping）**加入中间奖励（如夹爪接近物体、对准），引导探索，但设计不当会让策略钻空子。**后见经验回放（HER）**把&quot;失败&quot;重标为&quot;成功达到了某个其他目标&quot;，从失败中也榨取学习信号。**课程学习（curriculum）**从易到难——先抓简单孤立物体，再抓杂乱堆叠——逐步加难度。这些技术让稀疏奖励抓取变得可训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模真机-qt-opt-谱系\">大规模真机：QT-Opt 谱系</h2><p>Google 的 <strong>QT-Opt</strong> 是真机大规模抓取 RL 的里程碑：用多台机器人臂连续数月采集数十万次真实抓取尝试，训练一个基于 Q 学习的策略，从单目 RGB 直接输出抓取动作，在未见物体上达到很高成功率，还自发学出推开遮挡、重新抓取等非平凡行为——这些是模仿学习难以示范的。后续 <strong>MT-Opt</strong> 扩展到多任务。</p>\n<p>真机 RL 的优势是没有仿真到真机的鸿沟，学到的就是真实物理；劣势是成本惊人——硬件磨损、人力监管、时间动辄数月。因此除了财力雄厚的机构，绝大多数工作转向仿真训练。下表对比真机与仿真路线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>真机 RL</th>\n<th>仿真 RL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理真实性</td>\n<td>完美</td>\n<td>有建模误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采集成本</td>\n<td>极高（硬件/时间）</td>\n<td>低（并行廉价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>试错有风险</td>\n<td>无风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要挑战</td>\n<td>规模、磨损</td>\n<td>sim-to-real gap</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"仿真训练与-sim-to-real\">仿真训练与 sim-to-real</h2><p>主流路线是在仿真器（Isaac Gym/Isaac Lab、MuJoCo、PyBullet）里用数千个并行环境训练，再迁移到真机。Isaac Lab 利用 GPU 并行可同时跑上万个机器人实例，把原本数月的真机采集压缩到数小时仿真。但仿真与真实存在差异——摩擦、质量、相机噪声、光照都对不上，直接迁移往往失败。</p>\n<p><strong>域随机化（domain randomization）<strong>是跨越鸿沟的主力：训练时大幅随机化仿真参数（摩擦系数、物体质量、相机位姿、光照、纹理），逼策略学出对这些变化鲁棒的行为，于是真实世界只是它见过的&quot;又一种随机情形&quot;。其变体</strong>域适配</strong>则用少量真实数据微调。OpenAI 用域随机化在仿真训练灵巧手解魔方，是经典案例。仿真训练还天然适配<a href=\"../planning-control/force-compliant-control\">力控与柔顺控制</a>——可在仿真里学出隐式柔顺，避免真机试错损坏硬件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[仿真器 并行环境] --&gt; B[域随机化&lt;br/&gt;摩擦/质量/光照/相机]&#10;    B --&gt; C[RL 训练 PPO/SAC]&#10;    C --&gt; D[鲁棒策略]&#10;    D --&gt; E{迁移真机}&#10;    E --&gt;|成功| F[部署]&#10;    E --&gt;|gap 过大| G[少量真机数据域适配]&#10;    G --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[仿真器 并行环境] --&gt; B[域随机化&lt;br/&gt;摩擦/质量/光照/相机]\n    B --&gt; C[RL 训练 PPO/SAC]\n    C --&gt; D[鲁棒策略]\n    D --&gt; E{迁移真机}\n    E --&gt;|成功| F[部署]\n    E --&gt;|gap 过大| G[少量真机数据域适配]\n    G --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"强化学习在操作谱系中的位置\">强化学习在操作谱系中的位置</h2><p>强化学习的独特价值是<strong>超越示范、自我改进</strong>：它能发现人类没想到的抓法、对意外情况自适应、在线持续优化。但它样本低效、奖励难设、训练不稳，单用门槛高。因此 2025–2026 的实践很少纯 RL，而是组合：用<a href=\"imitation-learning\">模仿学习</a>做冷启动提供合理初始策略，再用 RL 微调突破示范上限；或在<a href=\"vla-models\">VLA 模型</a>预训练之上用 RL 做任务专精——π0.6 等 2026 SOTA 正是用自我改进（含 RL 式在线提升）推进实用灵巧度。</p>\n<p>RL 也反哺前几章：它学出的抓取策略隐式编码了<a href=\"../grasp-mechanics/force-form-closure\">力封闭</a>般的稳定性直觉，无需显式计算<a href=\"../grasp-mechanics/grasp-quality-metrics\">抓取质量度量</a>；它的动作输出可绕过显式<a href=\"../planning-control/kinematics-ik\">逆运动学</a>与<a href=\"../planning-control/trajectory-planning\">轨迹规划</a>，端到端从感知到动作——但代价是失去了模块化方法的可解释与可验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>强化学习把抓取建模为 MDP，用试错和奖励学策略，能超越示范上限、发现新抓法，但样本低效、奖励难设。</li>\n<li>稀疏奖励是头号难题，靠奖励塑形、后见经验回放（HER）、课程学习破解。</li>\n<li>QT-Opt 谱系用多机器人数月真机采集证明大规模 RL 可行，但成本惊人；主流转向仿真训练。</li>\n<li>仿真用 GPU 并行（Isaac Lab）廉价高效，域随机化跨越 sim-to-real 鸿沟，可在仿真里学隐式<a href=\"../planning-control/force-compliant-control\">柔顺控制</a>。</li>\n<li>RL 很少单用，多与<a href=\"imitation-learning\">模仿学习</a>冷启动、<a href=\"vla-models\">VLA 模型</a>预训练组合，端到端绕过显式<a href=\"../planning-control/kinematics-ik\">逆运动学</a>与<a href=\"../planning-control/trajectory-planning\">规划</a>但牺牲可解释性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"强化学习抓取策略","id":"强化学习抓取策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"抓取作为强化学习问题","id":"抓取作为强化学习问题"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模真机：QT-Opt 谱系","id":"大规模真机-qt-opt-谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"仿真训练与 sim-to-real","id":"仿真训练与-sim-to-real"},{"level":2,"text":"强化学习在操作谱系中的位置","id":"强化学习在操作谱系中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模仿学习与示教","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/imitation-learning"},"next":{"title":"视觉-语言-动作模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/vla-models"}}